        <body>
            <div xml:id="d69">

                <pb facs="0227" n="1187" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1187"/>

                <head>No. 782.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bragg to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-04-20"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 20, 1888</date>.
                        (Received April 30.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 28.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: From the inclosed clipping taken from the
                    Two Republics, of this morning you will see that the trial of Captain Munoz and
                    Lieutenant Cabrera, the officers implicated in the late invasion of American
                    soil at Eagle Pass, was commenced yesterday. The names of the jury are also
                    given.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Edwd. S. Bragg.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d69-a1.xml" xpointer="d69-a1"/>
